Subject: [PATCH] jasmine-j0128: sweetenv group @ui = SpringBoard + Preferences

The boot command line is capped at 607 bytes and the installed one uses 600,
so Settings (Preferences) cannot get an entry of its own. @ui shares one
DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES list between SpringBoard and Preferences; each injected
library checks which process it is in.

diff --git a/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c b/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
--- a/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
+++ b/bsd/kern/kern_exec.c
@@ -5622,6 +5622,9 @@
 		}
 		return 0;
 	}
+	if (n == 3 && strncmp(entry, "@ui", n) == 0) {
+		return strcmp(base, "SpringBoard") == 0 || strcmp(base, "Preferences") == 0;
+	}
 	return strlen(base) == n && strncmp(base, entry, n) == 0;
 }

